# Sweepstakes Tracker — conservative privacy + junk protections.
# The GitHub remote is PUBLIC. Personal exported data must never be committed.
#
# NOTE: this app is a single static file (sweepstakes.html) plus README.md.
# Neither of those is ignored below — only exported data, backups, and junk.

# --- Exported / personal sweepstakes data (JSON/CSV from in-app Export) ---
*.csv
*.json
# Re-allow project metadata files in case any are ever added:
!package.json
!package-lock.json

# --- Local backups / export dumps ---
exports/
backups/
*.backup
*.bak

# --- Logs ---
*.log

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Temporary / editor files ---
*.tmp
*.swp
